3e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Royale Smartwatch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Titanium Silver","offer_id":48816729587990,"sku":"20689","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden Metal","offer_id":48816729555222,"sku":"20690","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Strap","offer_id":48816729620758,"sku":"20942","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Strap","offer_id":48816729653526,"sku":"20943","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":48816729522454,"sku":"20688","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Royale_Black_0000_4bb22ca9-fa60-4044-8cc1-fbf9e718b57a.webp?v=1725970013"},{"product_id":"phantom-pro-smart-watch","title":"Phantom Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStrap in to endless possibilities with the Phantom Pro Smartwatch, featuring three Pro Straps designed for the active and never-ending lifestyle. Powered by a 2.04” HD Display with an Always On Display, the Phantom Pro showcases 100+ Pro Smartwatch Faces, an Active Health Suite, 100+ Workout Modes, and a 5 Day Battery for extended performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Phantom Pro:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Adventure Ready Straps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.04” HD Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlways On Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActive Health Suite\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u